1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,640
Venha descobrir

2
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:01,780
se você aguentaria ser

3
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:02,460
um pirata.

4
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,400
Esquece o cinema:

5
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,200
o navio era pequeno,

6
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:04,840
e o capitão podia

7
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,320
ser demitido no voto.

8
00:00:07,001 --> 00:00:08,201
O capitão Charles Vane

9
00:00:08,201 --> 00:00:09,181
se recusou a atacar

10
00:00:09,181 --> 00:00:09,521
um navio,

11
00:00:09,521 --> 00:00:10,461
e a tripulação trocou

12
00:00:10,461 --> 00:00:11,521
ele por Calico Jack.

13
00:00:13,875 --> 00:00:14,935
Fora da batalha,

14
00:00:14,935 --> 00:00:15,995
mandava junto um cargo

15
00:00:15,995 --> 00:00:17,055
que o cinema esquece:

16
00:00:17,055 --> 00:00:17,915
o quartel-mestre.

17
00:00:17,915 --> 00:00:18,975
Era ele quem dividia

18
00:00:18,975 --> 00:00:20,155
o tesouro e o rum.

19
00:00:20,531 --> 00:00:21,851
E você é só marujo.

20
00:00:21,851 --> 00:00:23,271
Sua cabeça coça de piolho,

21
00:00:23,271 --> 00:00:23,891
você bebe rum

22
00:00:23,891 --> 00:00:24,751
porque a água apodrece,

23
00:00:24,751 --> 00:00:25,911
e bate o biscoito

24
00:00:25,911 --> 00:00:27,871
na mesa pros carunchos caírem.

25
00:00:27,871 --> 00:00:28,871
Pelo menos pirata não

26
00:00:28,871 --> 00:00:29,711
tem regra, né?

27
00:00:30,084 --> 00:00:30,864
No filme,

28
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:31,484
o código é

29
00:00:31,484 --> 00:00:32,624
só uma sugestão.

30
00:00:32,624 --> 00:00:33,224
Na real,

31
00:00:33,224 --> 00:00:34,964
você jurava regras:

32
00:00:34,964 --> 00:00:36,104
oitocentas moedas de prata

33
00:00:36,104 --> 00:00:37,544
pra quem perdesse um braço.

34
00:00:37,544 --> 00:00:39,381
E quem operava esse braço?

35
00:00:39,381 --> 00:00:40,481
Muitas vezes,

36
00:00:40,481 --> 00:00:41,761
um cirurgião sequestrado

37
00:00:41,761 --> 00:00:42,681
de outro navio.

38
00:00:42,681 --> 00:00:43,221
Sem ele,

39
00:00:43,221 --> 00:00:44,161
operava o carpinteiro,

40
00:00:44,161 --> 00:00:44,801
com a serra

41
00:00:44,801 --> 00:00:45,841
de cortar madeira.

42
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,980
Até o músico era sequestrado,

43
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:48,800
pra tocar violino

44
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,940
no ataque e assustar

45
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:50,880
o outro navio.

46
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,940
E quem quebrava as regras?

47
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,320
Andava na prancha?

48
00:00:54,903 --> 00:00:56,183
O castigo real era pior,

49
00:00:56,183 --> 00:00:57,023
porque demorava:

50
00:00:57,023 --> 00:00:58,543
te largavam sozinho numa ilha,

51
00:00:58,543 --> 00:00:58,903
com um pouco

52
00:00:58,903 --> 00:01:00,023
de água e uma arma.

53
00:01:00,476 --> 00:01:01,676
As mesmas regras

54
00:01:01,676 --> 00:01:02,216
que te pagavam

55
00:01:02,216 --> 00:01:03,236
pelo braço te largaram

56
00:01:03,236 --> 00:01:03,876
na ilha.

57
00:01:03,876 --> 00:01:04,476
E aí,

58
00:01:04,476 --> 00:01:05,116
você teria coragem

59
00:01:05,116 --> 00:01:05,796
de ser um tripulante

60
00:01:05,796 --> 00:01:06,816
de um navio pirata?
